{
  "_comentario": [
    "Regras do Realtime Database (fonte). database.rules.json e GERADO a partir deste",
    "arquivo por scripts/build-db-rules.js (predeploy do firebase.json).",
    "",
    "Revisao de 2026-10-21 (auditoria):",
    "- companys/{handle} deixou de ser publico. Antes, qualquer pessoa que soubesse o handle",
    "  lia CPF/CNPJ, a agenda (nome e telefone dos clientes), pedidos e pagamentos.",
    "  Agora so membros leem o no inteiro; o publico le campo a campo (lista abaixo).",
    "- schedules e privado. Cliente final agenda, lista e cancela pela Cloud Function",
    "  bookingsApi (functions-backend/bookings.js), que confere conflito, plano e dono.",
    "- users/{uid}: dono, colegas da empresa atual e master. Publicos so name e description.",
    "- members/{uid}: alem dos membros, o convidado pode se incluir apontando um convite",
    "  pendente desta empresa, deste papel e para o e-mail da conta logada.",
    "- invites: so membros criam/gerenciam; o convidado so muda o status.",
    "- documentsIndex: so membros da empresa apontada gravam.",
    "- subscriptions: o assinante le as proprias (consulta por uid) e pede cancelamento.",
    "",
    "Lembrete: o Admin SDK (Cloud Functions) ignora estas regras."
  ],
  "rules": {
    ".read": false,
    ".write": false,
    "companiesIndex": {
      ".read": true,
      "$handle": {
        "_comentario": "Indice publico do Explorar. Nunca recebe documento, e-mail ou telefone.",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "document": {
          ".validate": false
        },
        "email": {
          ".validate": false
        },
        "phone": {
          ".validate": false
        }
      }
    },
    "documentsIndex": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$document": {
        "_comentario": "Le-se uma chave por vez (duplicidade de CPF/CNPJ). Grava so membro da empresa apontada.",
        ".read": "auth != null",
        ".write": "auth != null && ((newData.exists() && newData.isString() && root.child('companys').child(newData.val()).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()) || (!newData.exists() && data.exists() && root.child('companys').child(data.val()).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()))"
      }
    },
    "licenses": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Plano de cada EMPRESA (nao da pessoa): licenses/{handle}.",
        "Gravam so a conta master (tela Master Dev) e o backend",
        "(Cloud Function que confirma o pagamento, via Admin SDK).",
        "Nenhum membro da empresa, nem o administrador principal,",
        "consegue escrever aqui pelo navegador. Membros so leem."
      ],
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()"
      }
    },
    "companys": {
      "_comentario_master": "A leitura do no inteiro e exclusiva da conta master (painel Master Dev).",
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false,
      "$handle": {
        "_comentario": [
          "No inteiro: so membros (e master). O publico le os campos marcados com .read true.",
          "Criacao: so se quem cria ja entra como membro master na mesma gravacao."
        ],
        ".read": "auth != null && (data.child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() || (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com'))",
        ".write": "auth != null && ((!data.exists() && newData.child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master') || data.child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
        "name": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "handle": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "description": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "bio": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "category": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "categories": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "logoPreview": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "logoUrl": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "location": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "address": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "endereco": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "coordinates": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "phone": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "email": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "socialMedia": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "socials": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "socialLinks": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "businessHours": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "amenities": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "photos": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "theme": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "products": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "members": {
          "$uid": {
            "_comentario": "Aceite de convite por link: o proprio convidado se inclui, apontando o convite.",
            ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid && !data.exists() && newData.child('inviteId').isString() && root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('companyHandle').val() === $handle && root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('status').val() === 'pending' && root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('role').val() === newData.child('role').val() && (newData.child('role').val() === 'administrator' || newData.child('role').val() === 'professional') && (!root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('expiresAt').exists() || root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('expiresAt').val() > now) && auth.token.email != null && auth.token.email.toLowerCase() === root.child('invites').child(newData.child('inviteId').val()).child('invitedEmail').val().toLowerCase()",
            ".read": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid"
          },
          "_comentario": [
            "Privado (le-se pelo no da empresa, so membros). Cada pessoa le a PROPRIA entrada",
            "(saber se ja entrou). A aprovacao de pedido grava nome, e-mail e telefone aqui."
          ]
        },
        "integrations": {
          "whatsapp": {
            ".read": true
          }
        },
        "paymentSettings": {
          "receiveBeforeBooking": {
            ".read": true
          }
        },
        "paymentOrders": {
          "_comentario": "Acompanhamento do pagamento pelo id (impossivel listar). Grava o backend.",
          "$orderId": {
            ".read": true
          }
        },
        "schedules": {
          "_comentario": "Privado: nome e telefone dos clientes. Cliente final usa a bookingsApi.",
          ".indexOn": [
            "day",
            "professionalId",
            "userId",
            "clientId"
          ]
        },
        "subscriptions": {
          "_comentario": "Assinante le so as proprias (orderByChild('uid').equalTo(uid)) e pede cancelamento.",
          ".read": "auth != null && query.orderByChild === 'uid' && query.equalTo === auth.uid",
          ".indexOn": [
            "uid"
          ],
          "$subscriptionId": {
            ".read": "auth != null && ($subscriptionId.beginsWith(auth.uid + '_') || data.child('uid').val() === auth.uid)",
            "cancellationRequestedAt": {
              ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('subscriptions').child($subscriptionId).child('uid').val() === auth.uid",
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
            },
            "cancelScheduledFor": {
              ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('subscriptions').child($subscriptionId).child('uid').val() === auth.uid",
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
            },
            "updatedAt": {
              ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('subscriptions').child($subscriptionId).child('uid').val() === auth.uid",
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
            }
          }
        },
        "joinRequests": {
          "_comentario": [
            "Pedido de entrada numa empresa.",
            "",
            "Quem pede AINDA NAO e membro, entao a regra do $handle",
            "acima (que exige membro para escrever) o barraria. Esta",
            "regra mais funda devolve o acesso, mas so ao proprio no:",
            "cada pessoa escreve companys/{handle}/joinRequests/{seu uid}.",
            "",
            "O .validate impede o solicitante de se auto-aprovar: ele",
            "so consegue gravar status 'pending'. Mudar para 'approved'",
            "exige ser membro."
          ],
          "$uid": {
            ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
            ".write": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists())",
            ".validate": "!data.exists() || !newData.exists() || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() || newData.child('status').val() === 'pending'"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "users": {
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false,
      ".indexOn": [
        "email"
      ],
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && (auth.uid === $uid || (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com') || (root.child('users').child($uid).child('companyHandle').isString() && root.child('companys').child(root.child('users').child($uid).child('companyHandle').val()).child('members').child($uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child(root.child('users').child($uid).child('companyHandle').val()).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()))",
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid",
        "_comentario": [
          "Dono le e grava (inclusive companyHandle: so ele, nunca outra pessoa).",
          "Colegas leem quando o ALVO aponta companyHandle para uma empresa da qual ele e quem le sao membros.",
          "Antes, um membro da empresa A podia aprovar um joinRequest falso para qualquer uid, gravar o",
          "companyHandle da vitima para A e passar a ler users/{vitima}. Publicos: so name e description."
        ],
        "name": {
          "_comentario": "Nome publico (profissionais na pagina de agendamento).",
          ".read": true
        },
        "description": {
          ".read": true
        },
        "password": {
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.val() === data.val()"
        }
      }
    },
    "invites": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$inviteId": {
        "_comentario": [
          "Le-se pelo id do link. Criar/gerenciar: membros da empresa do convite.",
          "O convidado (e-mail da conta = invitedEmail) so altera status/aceite."
        ],
        ".read": true,
        ".write": "auth != null && ((!data.exists() && newData.exists() && newData.child('inviterUid').val() === auth.uid && root.child('companys').child(newData.child('companyHandle').val()).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()) || (data.exists() && root.child('companys').child(data.child('companyHandle').val()).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && (!newData.exists() || newData.child('companyHandle').val() === data.child('companyHandle').val())) || (data.exists() && newData.exists() && auth.token.email != null && auth.token.email.toLowerCase() === data.child('invitedEmail').val().toLowerCase() && newData.child('companyHandle').val() === data.child('companyHandle').val() && newData.child('role').val() === data.child('role').val() && newData.child('invitedEmail').val() === data.child('invitedEmail').val() && newData.child('inviterUid').val() === data.child('inviterUid').val()))"
      }
    },
    "mercadoPagoConnections": {
      ".read": false,
      ".write": false,
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()"
      }
    },
    "studioDrafts": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Rascunho do Markfy Studio. So membros da empresa leem;",
        "so responsavel/administrador grava (profissional so visualiza)."
      ],
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)"
      }
    },
    "studioSites": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Pagina publicada pelo Studio: leitura publica (rota /s/{handle}) SOMENTE enquanto",
        "a empresa tem plano ativo com Studio; escrita so por responsavel/administrador",
        "da propria empresa, tambem exigindo plano ativo com Studio."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)",
        ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(studio|both|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)"
      },
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "studioLeads": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Contatos do formulario da pagina publica.",
        "Visitante sem login so CRIA um contato novo com status 'new';",
        "ler, mudar estado e excluir exige ser membro (estado/exclusao: editor)."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "$leadId": {
          ".write": "(!data.exists() && newData.exists() && newData.child('status').val() === 'new') || (auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists() && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() !== 'professional')",
          ".validate": "!newData.exists() || newData.hasChildren(['name', 'status', 'createdAt'])",
          "name": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length > 0 && newData.val().length <= 120"
          },
          "phone": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 40"
          },
          "email": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 160"
          },
          "message": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 2000"
          },
          "status": {
            ".validate": "newData.val() === 'new' || newData.val() === 'contacted' || newData.val() === 'done' || newData.val() === 'archived'"
          },
          "source": {
            ".validate": "newData.isString() && newData.val().length <= 20"
          },
          "createdAt": {
            ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
          },
          "updatedAt": {
            ".validate": "newData.isNumber()"
          },
          "$other": {
            ".validate": false
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "studioAnalytics": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Contadores diarios da pagina publicada.",
        "Qualquer visitante so consegue SOMAR 1 a um evento conhecido do dia;",
        "nao da para apagar, zerar nem inventar evento. Leitura: membros."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        "$day": {
          ".validate": "$day.matches(/^[0-9]{4}-[0-9]{2}-[0-9]{2}$/)",
          "$event": {
            ".write": "newData.exists()",
            ".validate": "($event === 'view' || $event === 'booking_click' || $event === 'whatsapp_click' || $event === 'social_click' || $event === 'channel_click' || $event === 'lead') && newData.isNumber() && ((!data.exists() && newData.val() === 1) || newData.val() === data.val() + 1)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "planCatalog": {
      "_comentario": "Catalogo de planos: leitura publica (tela de planos), escrita so da conta master.",
      ".read": true,
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "planOrders": {
      "_comentario": "Pedidos de plano. Escrita so pelo backend (Admin SDK); a conta master le.",
      ".read": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')",
      ".write": false
    },
    "publicAccess": {
      "_comentario": "Espelho publico minimo da licenca (bookings/studio/menus/expiresAt). Leitura publica; escrita so da conta master e do backend.",
      ".read": true,
      ".write": "auth != null && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
    },
    "masterProfiles": {
      "_comentario": "Registro da troca da senha provisoria das contas master. Cada conta le e grava so o proprio no.",
      "$uid": {
        ".read": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid",
        ".write": "auth != null && auth.uid === $uid && (auth.token.email === 'caua.master@markfy.com' || auth.token.email === 'marcelo.master@markfy.com')"
      }
    },
    "menusCatalog": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Cardapios, categorias, produtos e adicionais do Markfy Menus.",
        "Leitura publica enquanto a licenca inclui o Menus (o cardapio publico le daqui);",
        "membros sempre leem. Escrita: dono, administrador ou gerente (menusStaff).",
        "A cozinha pode marcar produto como disponivel/indisponivel.",
        "Preco e validado como inteiro em centavos."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator' || (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'manager'))",
        "products": {
          "$productId": {
            "priceCents": {
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0 && newData.val() <= 100000000 && newData.val() % 1 === 0"
            },
            "promoPriceCents": {
              ".validate": "newData.isNumber() && newData.val() >= 0 && newData.val() % 1 === 0"
            },
            "available": {
              ".write": "auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'professional' && root.child('menusStaff').child($handle).child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'kitchen'",
              ".validate": "newData.isBoolean()"
            }
          }
        },
        "menus": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "order"
          ]
        },
        "categories": {
          ".indexOn": [
            "menuId",
            "order"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    "menusSettings": {
      "_comentario": [
        "Dados publicos da operacao: perfil, contato, horarios, entrega, formas de pagamento e endereco publico.",
        "Nada sigiloso deve morar aqui. Escrita: dono ou administrador."
      ],
      "$handle": {
        ".read": "(root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('status').val() === 'active' && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').isString() && root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('product').val().matches(/^(menus|all)$/) && (root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() === null || root.child('licenses').child($handle).child('expiresAt').val() > now)) || auth != null && root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).exists()",
        ".write": "auth != null && (root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'master' || root.child('companys').child($handle).child('members').child(auth.uid).child('role').val() === 'administrator')"
      }
    },
